<title>SPAIN: BCH, France Telecom, Sprint join in Retevision bid.</title>
<headline>BCH, France Telecom, Sprint join in Retevision bid.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish bank BCH, France Telecom and Sprint said on Monday that they had joined forces to make a bid for 60 percent of Retevision, which will be Spain's second basic telephone operator.</p>
<p>They said Deutsche Telekom had withdrawn from the group.</p>
</text>
